   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "At the Claude Monet bar, Kostya the bartender and Sasha the waitress compare notes. They've been staging a little game to make Max jealous, and Sasha has just told Max a story of her own. Kostya wants to make the fake plan look more real. Listen in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
